  title: '"I" Met 21 Hugging Frogs'
  sentences:
  - ——Once upon a time, there was a child who had always lived in the world of time.
  - One day, the order of time was disrupted, and the child fell through time into a mirror world.
  - In that mirror world, he encountered many brilliant, colorful hugging frogs, and embarked on a journey of the heart.
